## Initial Risk Profile

Swing SL and 1R target for P2. P2 uses `RISK_FIXED = 1000 USD`; live default remains `RISK_PERCENT = 0.25`.

## Implementation Notes

- Use Senkou Span B value aligned to the current closed bar as provided by MT5 Ichimoku buffers.
- Avoid entering while a prior position for this magic is open.
